 "short_name": "Theewaterskloof",
 "_doc": "Theewaterskloof LM (Caledon). Two layouts: (a) 9 gyro-printed statements whose header values are UNLABELLED (statement date, street, account no., town, invoice no. in a right-hand column; then stand/valuation/rate/deposit row) and (b) one 'MONTHLY MUNICIPAL ACCOUNT' (WC031) whose date is an unfilled '##DATEACCOUNT##' placeholder (billing_date blank there). Ledger: 'T<meter> Electricity' then registers KVA DEMAND / OFF PEAK / STANDARD / PEAK '(LV D)' 'current-previous=units  amount', 'n x Network Access KVA' (nmd_kva = n, nmd_r) and 'Electricity Basic' (other_r). EVERY AMOUNT IS VAT-INCLUSIVE with no per-line VAT; the statement prints the VAT included ('VAT INCLUSIVE'). Ex-VAT Rand columns are therefore incl x 100/115 (constant via label_present). Fingerprint: the name (only layout b prints the municipal VAT number, kept in 'any'). IDENTITY: tw_elec_ex_check_r = electricity incl - (printed statement VAT - VAT share of the starred non-electricity lines), layout b: printed ELEC. service-summary x 100/115; vs total_ex_vat_r: R0.00 on 7, <=R0.02 on 3. Checked on 10 bills.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "THEEWATERSKLOOF"
  ],
  "any": [
   "4000846248",
   "Theewaterskloof Municipality",
   "Theewaterskloof Munisipaliteit"
  ]
 },
 "sections": {
  "electricity": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*(?:\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}[ \\t]+)?T\\d+[ \\t]+Electricity\\b",
   "overlay": true,
   "end": "Electricity[ \\t]+Basic[^\\n]*\\n"
  }
 },
 "fields": [
  {
   "label": "Account number (unlabelled right column / ACCOUNT No.)",
   "scope": "document",
   "field": "account_number",
   "patterns": [
    "^[ \\t]{40,}(\\d{10})[ \\t]*$",
    "REKENING No\\.[ \\t]+(\\d{10})"
   ],
   "type": "text",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "label": "Statement date (unlabelled, above account no.)",
   "scope": "document",
   "field": "billing_date",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]{40,}(\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{4})[ \\t]*\\n[^\\n]*\\n[ \\t]{40,}\\d{10}[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "date",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "label": "Site street (line above account no.)",
   "scope": "document",
   "field": "tw_street",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*(\\S[^\\n]*?)[ \\t]*\\n[ \\t]{40,}\\d{10}[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "label": "Site town (line below account no.)",
   "scope": "document",
   "field": "tw_town",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]{40,}\\d{10}[ \\t]*\\n[ \\t]*([A-Z][A-Z ]+?)[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
